<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: If it succeeds, the slave becomes the chooser's lover and grows fond of them. If it fails, the slave resists the selection and comes to dislike the chooser. The higher the chooser's animals skill, the higher the ritual quality; the outcome decides the chance of success (Low 30% / Normal 45% / High 60%). -->
  <Weazel_TrophySelection.ritualExplanation>若成功，奴隸會成為欽點者的戀人並對其產生好感。若失敗，奴隸會抗拒欽點並開始厭惡欽點者。欽點者的動物技能越高，儀式品質就越高；結果決定成功率（低30%、普通45%、高60%）。</Weazel_TrophySelection.ritualExplanation>
</LanguageData>
